@startuml finds-sequence
actor User
participant UI
participant Worker
participant R2
participant NASA
participant Gemini

User -> UI: Generate hotspots
UI -> Worker: POST /api/hotspots
Worker -> Worker: validate region, n, bbox
Worker -> R2: GET cache key
alt HIT
  R2 --> Worker: cached JSON
else MISS
  Worker -> NASA: GIBS WMS SST + chlorophyll
  NASA --> Worker: PNG visualizations
  Worker -> Worker: decode colormap, grid cells
  Worker -> Gemini: score/explain cells only
  Gemini --> Worker: scores + rationales
  Worker -> R2: PUT result
end
Worker --> UI: hotspots + provenance
UI -> User: map render or fallback
@enduml
